<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $1.00-1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 higher. Top $56.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    56.00-56.50</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-280 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $47.50.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    350-450 lbs    scarce</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    45.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    500-600 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
</text>
